{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01R9sLRqa4XcqAHLJMMCdA5C","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# ADR 0004: One repository for the web, API and workers\n2\t\n3\tDate: 2023-11-02\n4\tStatus: Superseded by ADR 0009\n5\t\n6\t## Context\n7\t\n8\tThree repositories meant three CI pipelines and a release train that took a week to coordinate. Shared types drifted between the API and the web client twice in October 2023.\n9\t\n10\t## Decision\n11\t\n12\tThe web client, the API and the background workers move into one repository with a single CI pipeline and a shared `packages/types` module.\n13\t\n14\t## Consequences\n15\t\n16\t- Positive: one pull request changes a type and both its producers and consumers.\n17\t- Negative: CI runs take 18 minutes end to end; selective builds are a follow-up.\n18\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"94a07d2b-9bd5-4a87-96ca-f41c8ab7fa77","uuid":"81a26131-7951-402c-b5d7-54e5fe10ee14","timestamp":"2026-11-15T18:37:54.812Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/jcarr/.cache/markdownattractor/bench-a/t6/golden/src/adr/0004-monorepo.md","content":"# ADR 0004: One repository for the web, API and workers\n\nDate: 2023-11-02\nStatus: Superseded by ADR 0009\n\n## Context\n\nThree repositories meant three CI pipelines and a release train that took a week to coordinate. Shared types drifted between the API and the web client twice in October 2023.\n\n## Decision\n\nThe web client, the API and the background workers move into one repository with a single CI pipeline and a shared `packages/types` module.\n\n## Consequences\n\n- Positive: one pull request changes a type and both its producers and consumers.\n- Negative: CI runs take 18 minutes end to end; selective builds are a follow-up.\n","numLines":18,"startLine":1,"totalLines":18}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01R9sLRqa4XcqAHLJMMCdA5C","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch5CXiMMjLzDnXYahgopJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Reasons for moving workers out** (`adr/0009-split-workers-repo.md`, Context and Consequences):\n- The workers team ships on a different cadence.\n- Their Python toolchain doubled the monorepo's CI time. Moving them cuts CI from 18 to 7 minutes.\n\n**Effect of publishing shared types:** `adr/0004-monorepo.md` (Context) put everything in one repo partly because shared types drifted between the API and web client twice in October 2023. ADR 0009 says the versioned `@acme/types` package, pinned by minor version, \"removes the drift problem ADR 0004 solved.\" That is why ADR 0009 supersedes ADR 0004. The cost is that a type change now needs a package release before workers can use it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":750,"cache_read_input_tokens":6228,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":750},"output_tokens":251,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"94a07d2b-9bd5-4a87-96ca-f41c8ab7fa77","uuid":"b874f88b-7516-4f7f-8559-c03d517e6f78","timestamp":"2026-11-15T18:37:56.924Z","request_id":"req_011Ch5CXiBwAdCh2unCAnTez"}
